<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="433018366"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1161896737"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Ain't My Fault (R3HAB Remix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Zara Larsson / R3HAB"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Ain't My Fault (R3hab Remix)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:38.773"><div begin="00:00.000" end="02:21.649"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:03.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">It ain't my fault you keep turnin' me on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错 你让我激情澎湃</span></p><p begin="00:03.597" end="00:06.599" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">It ain't my fault you got, got me so gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错 你让我沉醉其中</span></p><p begin="00:06.811" end="00:09.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">It ain't my fault I'm not leavin' alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错 我绝不会独自离开</span></p><p begin="00:09.947" end="00:13.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">It ain't my fault you keep turnin' me on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错 你让我激情澎湃</span></p><p begin="00:12.799" end="00:13.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I can't talk right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我说不出话</span></p><p begin="00:14.112" end="00:15.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I'm lookin' and I like what I'm seein'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是看着 我喜欢眼前的一切</span></p><p begin="00:15.244" end="00:16.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Got me feelin' kinda shocked right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我有些震惊</span></p><p begin="00:16.349" end="00:17.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Couldn't stop right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我想</span></p><p begin="00:17.181" end="00:19.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Even if I wanted, gotta get it, get it, get it, when it's hot right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也无法停下</span></p><p begin="00:19.735" end="00:21.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Oh my god, what is this?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我是那么 那么热血沸腾</span></p><p begin="00:21.333" end="00:22.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Want you all in my business<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要插手我的事</span></p><p begin="00:22.971" end="00:23.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Baby, I insist<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的 我坚持</span></p><p begin="00:23.796" end="00:26.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Please don't blame me for what ever happens next<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接下来会发生什么那就请不要怪我了</span></p><p begin="00:26.753" end="00:29.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">No, I-I-I-I can't be responsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我无关</span></p><p begin="00:29.899" end="00:32.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">If I-I-I-I get you in trouble now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我让你惹上麻烦</span></p><p begin="00:32.843" end="00:35.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">See, you're-'re-'re-'re too irresistible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看你是那么暴躁易怒</span></p><p begin="00:35.827" end="00:37.628" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Yeah, that's for sure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这毫无疑问</span></p><p begin="00:37.628" end="00:41.714" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">So, if I put your hands where my eyes can't see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就把你的手甩向我看不见的高空</span></p><p begin="00:42.003" end="00:44.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Then you're the one who's got a hold on me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是唯一一个能掌控我的人</span></p><p begin="00:46.038" end="00:50.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">No, I-I-I-I can't be responsible, responsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我无关 与我无关</span></p><p begin="00:50.718" end="00:51.821" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">It ain't my fault<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错</span></p><p begin="01:04.003" end="01:07.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">It ain't my fault you came here lookin' like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错 你的神情像是</span></p><p begin="01:07.410" end="01:10.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">You just made me trip, fall, and land on your lap<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我跌进爱的深渊 出现在你的领地</span></p><p begin="01:10.764" end="01:12.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Certain bad boy smooth<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无疑问的狂喜</span></p><p begin="01:12.254" end="01:13.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Body hotter than a summer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你火辣过阳光</span></p><p begin="01:13.904" end="01:16.894" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">I don't mean to be rude, but I'd look so damn good on ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我没有恶意 但我真的喜欢你</span></p><p begin="01:17.000" end="01:18.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Ain't got time right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在没有时间</span></p><p begin="01:18.270" end="01:19.071" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Missed me with that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想念我</span></p><p begin="01:19.120" end="01:20.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">What's your name, your sign, right now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">&quot;你叫什么 你什么星座&quot;</span></p><p begin="01:20.527" end="01:21.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">It's light outside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">外面灯亮起</span></p><p begin="01:21.349" end="01:23.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I just called an Uber and it's right outside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我打了辆车 在外面的感觉真好</span></p><p begin="01:23.530" end="01:25.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Oh my god, what is this?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢天啊 这是怎么回事</span></p><p begin="01:25.596" end="01:26.977" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Want you all in my business<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要插手我的事</span></p><p begin="01:26.977" end="01:27.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Baby, I insist<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的 我坚持</span></p><p begin="01:27.957" end="01:30.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Please don't blame me for what ever happens next<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接下来会发生什么那就请不要怪我了</span></p><p begin="01:30.757" end="01:33.889" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">No, I-I-I-I can't be responsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我无关</span></p><p begin="01:33.889" end="01:36.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">If I-I-I-I get you in trouble now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我让你惹上麻烦</span></p><p begin="01:36.939" end="01:39.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">See, you're-'re-'re-'re too irresistible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看你是那么暴躁易怒</span></p><p begin="01:39.861" end="01:41.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Yeah, that's for sure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这毫无疑问</span></p><p begin="01:41.682" end="01:46.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">So, if I put your hands where my eyes can't see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就把你的手甩向我看不见的高空</span></p><p begin="01:46.073" end="01:49.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Then you're the one who's got a hold on me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是唯一一个能掌控我的人</span></p><p begin="01:49.333" end="01:54.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">No, I-I-I-I can't be responsible, responsible<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我无关 与我无关</span></p><p begin="01:54.771" end="01:55.713" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">It ain't my fault<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错</span></p><p begin="02:20.317" end="02:21.649" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">It ain't my fault<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不是我的错</span></p></div></body></tt>